      "text": "The Competent Authority has approved the appointment of Shri Ajay Kumar Jaiswal, IRSME(2008) as CVO, Northern Coalfields Ltd. (NCL), Singrauli under the Ministry of Coal with pay at level 13 (Rs. 1,23,100 – 2,15,900/-) of the pay matrix, for an initial period of 3 years from the date of assumption of charge of the post or until further orders, whichever is earlier."
